#. ja: ナッキ島のリヌバリは、冒険者に伝えたいことがあるようだ。
#. de: Linu Vali möchte dir etwas mitteilen.
#. fr: Linu Vali a les larmes aux yeux en vous voyant.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Linu Vali smiles at you warmly, and it looks like she has something to say."
msgstr ""

#. ja: リヌバリから、冒険者の働きを感謝された。長老リヌバヌからも、感謝の言葉があるらしい。ナッキ島の「群雲のリヌバヌ」と話そう。
#. de: Linu Vali möchte dir danken, doch die Gefühle überwältigen sie und lassen sie nach den richtigen Worten suchen. Sie schickt dich zu Linu Vanu, der sich ebenfalls bei dir bedanken möchte.
#. fr: Linu Vali vous a dit vous être tellement re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sante pour tout ce que vous avez fait pour elle et les siens qu'elle ne saurait l'exprimer cor<shy>rec<shy>te<shy>ment. Elle vous a toutefois annoncé que son frère, Linu Vanu, désirait lui aussi vous remercier.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Linu Vali once again expresses her gratitude for everything you have done for her tribe. Her brother also wishes to express his thanks, and looks deep in thought. Speak with him to hear what words his meditative mood has brought to him."
msgstr ""

#. ja: リヌバヌと話した。彼から感謝の言葉を受け、冒険者はグンド族の「鮮やかな友」として迎えられた。
#. de: Auch Linu Vanu ist von Gefühlen der Dankbarkeit überwältigt, doch nach anfänglichem Stocken fließen die Worte rasch wieder. Er dankt dir in bildreicher Sprache im Namen aller Gundo und betrachtet dich nun als <if $gn4>treue Freundin<else>treuen Freund</if> der Gundo.
#. fr: En vous voyant, le chef du village d'Ok' Gundu Nakki  a trouvé les mots qu'il cherchait depuis quelque temps pour vous dire à quel point lui et ses camarades vous doivent. Selon lui, votre courage, votre gentillesse, votre dévouement, votre amitié, votre générosité, votre force et votre sagesse sont comme les sept couleurs d'un arc-en-ciel qui veille sur les Gundu, très haut dans L'Écume des cieux. Il a également ajouté que vous étiez leur plus grand<if $gn4>e</if> ami<if $gn4>e</if>, et même un membre à part entière de leur clan. Cette déclaration vous a fait chaud au cœur, et vous vous dites que vous n'oublierez jamais les aventures que vous avez vécues dans les nuages en compagnie de Linu Vali et des autres.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "You speak with Linu Vanu, and despite his initial difficulties in figuring out what to say, he finally finds words that adequately express his gratitude. He names you an honored guest of the Gundu, and says you will be welcome with open arms whenever you wish to visit Ok' Gundu Nakki."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 群雲のリヌバヌと話す
#. de: Mit Linu Vanu sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Linu Vanu
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Linu Vanu."
msgstr ""

#. ja: まぁ、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん。<br>いつも、いつも、ありがとうございます。<br>たくさん、働いてくれたこと…………。
#. de:  <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eeh! Na-Vanu-eeh hat so viel für Gundo-ooh getan! 
#. fr: Oh, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Je tiens à te remercier pour tout ce que tu as fait pour nous...
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVALI_000_000:1"
msgid "<split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, Ok' Gundu Nakki thrives more than ever. To think about the hardships <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> helps us through..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 喩えようもないくらい、感謝しています！！
#. de: Herz von Linu Vali-ooh sprudelt über vor Dankbarkeit wie ... möchte platzen vor Dankbarkeit wie ... Dankbarkeit ist größer, als Worte es jemals beschreiben könnten!
#. fr: Mais à vrai dire, je sais pas à quoi comparer ce sentiment de gratitude.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVALI_000_001:1"
msgid "Linu Vali knows words are wind, but she thanks you with all her heart! <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> is as sibling born in same nest!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 私たちの長老リヌバヌも、<br>改めて、貴方に感謝の言葉を伝えたいようです。<br>どうか、「群雲のリヌバヌ」に声をかけてください。
#. de: Häuptling Linu Vanu-ooh möchte <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eeh ebenfalls danken. Aus seinem Mund sprudeln immer richtige Worte wie Fluss, der nie ... Na-Vanu-eeh soll zu Linu Vanu-ooh eilen, um Dank entgegenzunehmen.
#. fr: Notre chef Linu Vanu aimerait lui aussi te dire merci. Je t'en prie, va le voir lorsque tu auras le temps.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVALI_000_002:1"
msgid "Linu Vanu wishes to express thanks to <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> as well. Go to him, he is eager to share his words."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 私たちの長老リヌバヌも、<br>改めて、貴方に感謝の言葉を伝えたいようです。<br>どうか、「群雲のリヌバヌ」に声をかけてください。
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eeh soll zu Linu Vanu-ooh gehen, um Dank entgegenzunehmen. Soll eilen wie ... Schnell!
#. fr: Notre chef Linu Vanu aimerait te dire merci pour tout ce que tu as fait pour nous. Je t'en prie, va le voir lorsque tu auras le temps.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVALI_000_005:1"
msgid "Linu Vanu wishes to thank <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> for guiding Gundu safely through the storm. Go to him, he is eager to speak with you!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おお、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>よ。<br>ずっと、ずっと、お主の偉大な働きに感謝する、<br>相応しき喩えを探していたのだ…………。
#. de: Na-Vanu-eeh! Herz von Linu Vanu-ooh fühlt Dankbarkeit so groß wie ... wie ... Wo ist Sprache? Wo sind richtige Worte?
#. fr: Brave <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, tu as fait tellement de choses pour permettre à notre village de prendre forme et de prospérer que les mots me manquent pour te remercier.
#. speaker: LINUVANU
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVANU_000_010:1"
msgid "Ah, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, it brings Linu Vanu joy to see you again. For moons does Linu Vanu seek metaphor to express thanks for netherling's actions... "
msgstr ""

#. ja: しかし、なかなか見つからなかった……。
#. de: Sind weg ...! Weg!
#. fr: J'ai pourtant longtemps cherché une expression digne du sentiment que tous les habitants d'Ok' Gundu Nakki partagent à ton égard...
#. speaker: LINUVANU
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVANU_000_011:1"
msgid "But moon sets and sun rises time and again, and still proper words do not come."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それが、それが、<br>こうして、お主を前にして、今まさに浮かんだ！
#. de: Ah! Eingebung trifft Linu Vanu-ooh wie Blitz Baum! Na-Vanu-eehs Anblick lässt Worte wieder sprudeln wie Quelle, die nie versiegt.
#. fr: Mais maintenant que tu es devant moi, je crois bien avoir trouvé<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LINUVANU
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVANU_000_012:1"
msgid "However, now that <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> stands before me, it is clear!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 我が「鮮やかなグンド」は、<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>の働きに、<br>雲海にかかる七色の虹のように、鮮やかに感謝する！
#. de: Gundo-ooh möchten Na-Vanu-eeh danken aus Herzen tiefer als Wolkenmeeresgrund für alles, was <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> für sie getan hat. Neigen Kopf vor Na-Vanu-eeh, wie Äste von Früchten schwer beladen sich zur Erde neigen. 
#. fr: Ton courage, ta gentillesse, ton dévouement, ton amitié, ta générosité, ta force et ta sagesse sont comme les sept couleurs d'un arc-en-ciel qui veille sur nous, très haut dans L'Écume des cieux<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LINUVANU
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVANU_000_013:1"
msgid "A netherling such as <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> is more precious than double─no, <i>triple</i>─rainbow stretching all the way across cloud sea!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: これからは、これからは、<br>お主を、我がグンド最上の客人「鮮やかな友」として迎えよう！
#. de: Von nun an ist Na-Vanu-eeh <if $gn4>treue Freundin<else>treuer Freund</if> von Gundo-ooh. Herzen sind verbunden wie Sterne mit Himmel und schlagen im Gleichtakt wie Puls von Erde mit Puls von Mond. Möge Na-Vanu-eeh stets auf Sonnenseite von Leben stehen und Schicksalswinde <if $gn4>ihr<else>ihm</if> Glück und Frieden bringen!
#. fr: Nous te considérons comme l<if $gn4>a<else>e</if> plus grand<if $gn4>e</if> ami<if $gn4>e</if> des Gundu<nbsp>! Tu es un<if $gn4>e</if> des nôtres<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LINUVANU
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_LINUVANU_000_014:1"
msgid "From this day onward, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> will be welcome in Ok' Gundu Nakki as a most honored guest!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「バヌバヌ族：鮮やかなグンド」との友好関係が、<br>「誓約★」になりました。<br>冒険者の働きによって、彼らと固い約束で結ばれたようです。
#. de: Dein Verhältnis zu den Gundo hat sich zu „Solidarisch★“ verbessert! Ein starkes Band der Loyalität verbindet euch nun.
#. fr: Votre réputation auprès des Vanu Vanu d'Ok' Gundu Nakki est passée à “Assermenté★”. Tout ce que vous avez fait pour eux vous a permis de créer des liens très forts avec les Gundu.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_SYSTEM_000_100:1"
msgid "You have achieved <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bloodsworn</ui-edge-color></ui-color> reputation with the Gundu."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これ以降、「バヌバヌ族：鮮やかなグンド」の、<br>「友好部族デイリークエスト」で獲得できる経験値に、<br>よりいっそうのボーナスが付加されます！
#. de: Ab jetzt erhältst du für abgeschlossene Aufträge der Freundesvölker noch mehr Routine als zuvor.
#. fr: Vous bénéficiez désormais d'un bonus de points d'expérience encore plus important lorsque vous finissez une quête quotidienne de ce peuple.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/022/BanVan008_02225:TEXT_BANVAN008_02225_SYSTEM_100_100:1"
msgid "You will receive an experience point bonus upon the completion of Vanu Vanu society daily quests."
msgstr ""
